{"seq":1,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"imported","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1674"},"reason":"Article of the Quiztopia bank (written for card c140): researched and transcribed in September 2026, converted to the quiz platform on 2026-10-20.","by":"Quiztopia import","ref":"quiz-archive/transcripts/quiztopia/c140.json"},
{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1674"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge history/modern-history","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/history__modern-history.g2.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",442],["+","In Britain the campaign became famous for its militancy. From 1903 Emmeline Pankhurst's Women's Social and Political Union fought for women's right to vote with mass marches, smashed windows, arson and hunger strikes; the Daily Mail mocked its members as \"suffragettes\", a name they adopted with pride. Women over 30 who met a property qualification won the vote in 1918, and equal terms with men followed in 1928.\n\n"],["=",194],["+","1971 – so the Swiss federal franchise dates only from "],["=",2],["+","more than half a century after Germany's – "],["=",120],["+","Kingdom | 1918 (women over 30), 1928 (equal terms) |\n| United "],["=",103]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",416],["+","In Großbritannien wurde der Kampf durch seine Militanz berühmt. Ab 1903 forderte die Women's Social and Political Union von Emmeline Pankhurst das Frauenwahlrecht mit Massenmärschen, eingeworfenen Fensterscheiben, Brandanschlägen und Hungerstreiks; die Daily Mail verspottete ihre Mitglieder als „Suffragetten“, ein Name, den sie stolz annahmen. Frauen über 30, die eine Vermögensvoraussetzung erfüllten, erhielten 1918 das Wahlrecht, die volle Gleichstellung mit den Männern folgte 1928.\n\n"],["=",182],["-","hatte,"],["+","hatte"],["=",1],["+","– das eidgenössische Frauenstimmrecht stammt also erst von 1971, mehr als ein halbes Jahrhundert nach dem deutschen – "],["=",98],["+","Großbritannien | 1918 (Frauen über 30), 1928 (gleichgestellt) |\n| "],["=",99]]}]},
